  <string name="areamap_route_advice_short">Short route: carry normal water reserve, a charged phone and a wind layer.</string>
  <string name="areamap_route_advice_long">Long route: take extra water/food, a power bank, headlamp and leave a time reserve for the return.</string>
  <string name="areamap_route_advice_climb">Large ascent: take a warm layer, wind/rain protection, extra food and start earlier.</string>
  <string name="areamap_route_advice_high">Above 2500 m: expect colder/windier conditions and watch for altitude illness; do not keep ascending if symptoms worsen.</string>
  <string name="areamap_route_advice_steep">Steep sections detected: be especially careful on descents, wet ground, scree and when tired.</string>
  <string name="areamap_route_advice_night">Part of the route is expected to be in darkness: a headlamp is essential; start earlier or shorten the route.</string>
